<section class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-12 py-32">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-16 border-b border-outline-variant/10 pb-8">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif">The Scent Verdict</h2>
      <div class="flex gap-4 mt-6">
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-surface-container-high text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold">Compliment Getter</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-surface-container-high text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold">Office Friendly</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-surface-container-high text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold">Longevity King</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-right">
      <p class="text-5xl font-serif text-primary">4.9</p>
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">From 248 Curators</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg leading-relaxed">"A masterpiece of restraint. The Oudh is present but never overwhelming, perfectly balanced by the sweetness of vanilla."</p>
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">— Julian V.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg leading-relaxed">"The transition from the saffron top note to the sandalwood base is the most seamless I've ever experienced."</p>
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">— Elena M.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg leading-relaxed">"I wore this to a gala and was stopped four times to be asked what I was wearing. Truly exceptional projection."</p>
      <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">— Marcus T.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product Reviews",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
